text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaIntro {
    "I'll show you the sublime techniques\n"
    "I learned from our LEADER JUAN!$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaDefeat {
    "Please forgive me, JUAN…$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaPostBattle {
    "Watch what happens if you crack all\n"
    "the floor tiles.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyIntro {
    "You came all the way here, but you won't\n"
    "get to see JUAN.\p"
    "Not if you lose to me, you won't!$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyDefeat {
    "You're strong!\n"
    "I was fooled by your cute looks!$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyPostBattle {
    "You might be good enough to avoid\n"
    "being wiped out in one hit by JUAN.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphneIntro {
    "The sight of JUAN conducting\n"
    "a battle…\p"
    "The very beauty of it compelled me to\n"
    "become a TRAINER.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphneDefeat {
    "You battled with more beauty than\n"
    "I could muster…$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphnePostBattle {
    "The grace you bring to battle is\n"
    "fabulous.\p"
    "Oh… I'm so fortunate to have found\n"
    "POKéMON.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConnieIntro {
    "I should teach you how harsh battles\n"
    "can be.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConnieDefeat {
    "Oh.\n"
    "You're strong.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConniePostBattle {
    "I'll tell you something good.\p"
    "If you want to reach JUAN, you\n"
    "need to walk on each floor tile once.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BridgetIntro {
    "The POKéMON GYM of the highest level\n"
    "in the HOENN region…\p"
    "That's the SOOTOPOLIS GYM.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BridgetDefeat {
    "What a high level you are!$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BridgetPostBattle {
    "Rather than being satisfied by being\n"
    "in a strong GYM, I imagine training in\l"
    "other places will make you stronger.\l"
    "But above all, it looks more fun.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_OliviaIntro {
    "I train my POKéMON together with\n"
    "JUAN.\p"
    "Don't think I'm a pushover.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_OliviaDefeat {
    "I was beaten…$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_OliviaPostBattle {
    "I think you have potential.\n"
    "Why don't you stay and train with us?$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_TiffanyIntro {
    "A graceful glide across the ice while\n"
    "crossing no lines…\p"
    "A TRAINER putting on that performance\n"
    "would be elegantly beautiful!$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_TiffanyDefeat {
    "Well, excuse me?!$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_TiffanyPostBattle {
    "This is really obvious, but how strong\n"
    "you are as a TRAINER has nothing to do\l"
    "with how young or old you are.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BethanyIntro {
    "When I'm with my POKéMON, the time\n"
    "flies by before you can say, “Oops!”$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BethanyDefeat {
    "Oops!$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BethanyPostBattle {
    "I wish I could forget about lost causes\n"
    "before I can manage an “Oops!”$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaIntro {
    "I can battle with really rare POKéMON\n"
    "if you'd like.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaDefeat {
    "Oh, there now! Did you have a good look\n"
    "at my POKéMON?$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaPostBattle {
    "I came to this GYM because JUAN\n"
    "praised me for my darling POKéMON.\p"
    "Oh, if only I'd met JUAN years ago\n"
    "when I was younger…$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaIntro {
    "Giggle…\n"
    "Your grim look is so charming.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaDefeat {
    "Oh, dear.\n"
    "I went much too easy on you.$"
}

text SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaPostBattle {
    "You couldn't lay a finger on JUAN,\n"
    "I'm sure. Giggle…$"
}
